    "name":  "Instant Insurance",
    "slug":  "instant-insurance",
    "teaser":  "Receive your insured items immediately after death!",
    "thumbnail":  "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/R9be2kXENr7Znt6JtoEaWNzJAQvrIfpQxucNy9uP.png",
    "downloads":  29932,
    "favourites_count":  44,
    "description":  "\u003cp\u003ePrapor and Therapist’s teams have been reorganized — they’re now faster and more efficient at recovering your items, delivering them straight to your equipment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cblockquote class=\"is-warning\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNOTICE\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e: This mod processes insurance immediately \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eONLY AFTER DEATH\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e. When surviving a raid, your items dropped in-raid goes through the \u003cem\u003eregular\u003c/em\u003e insurance system.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNOTICE\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e: Be sure to \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003einsure\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e the items you want to keep.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tabset\"\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tab-title\"\u003eConfiguration\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab-content\"\u003e\u003ch4\u003eConfiguration\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn the configuration file \u003ccode\u003econfig.json\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eSimulateItemsBeingTaken\u003c/code\u003e - If enabled, items can be taken before the insurer can retrieve your item. Chance to keep an item depends on which trader you insured your item from, (Prapor: \u003ccode\u003e85%\u003c/code\u003e; Therapist: \u003ccode\u003e95%\u003c/code\u003e, default server settings). Default is \u003ccode\u003etrue\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eLoseInsuranceOnItemAfterDeath\u003c/code\u003e - If enabled, insurance status will be lost on death. Default is \u003ccode\u003etrue\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eLoseAmmoInMagazines\u003c/code\u003e - If enabled, ammo that is loaded into an insured magazine will NOT be kept. Default is \u003ccode\u003efalse\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tab-title\"\u003eInstallation\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab-content\"\u003e\u003ch4\u003eInstallation\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExtract the contents of the .zip archive into your SPT directory\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3N6gTe2.gif\" alt=\"Installation\" /\u003e\nThank you \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/27605/drakiaxyz\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eDrakiaXYZ\u003c/a\u003e for the gif\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eRecommended Mods\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMods that alter insurance prices and/or insurance return percentages. It is recommended to increase insurance prices to balance the changes done by this mod. \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/236/server-value-modifier-svm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eSVM\u003c/a\u003e by \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/3972/ghostfenixx\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eGhostFenixx\u003c/a\u003e, and \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1547/trader-qol\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTraderQOL\u003c/a\u003e by \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/41131/mattdokn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMattdokn\u003c/a\u003e provides options for changing insurance related options\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eCompatibility\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTested to be compatible with \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2326/project-fika\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eProject Fika\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncompatible\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2032/nocheese\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eNoCheese\u003c/a\u003e as of version 1.0.3\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tab-title\"\u003eFAQs\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab-content\"\u003e\u003ch4\u003eFAQs:\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhy am I losing \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003esome\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e of my items even though \u003ccode\u003eSimulateItemsBeingTaken\u003c/code\u003e is \u003ccode\u003efalse\u003c/code\u003e?\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInsurance is processed immediately \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eONLY AFTER DEATH\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e. When surviving a raid, your items dropped in-raid goes through the \u003cem\u003eregular\u003c/em\u003e insurance system\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYou can still lose items if they’re uninsured\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInspect your server logs, they contain information on how your items were processed after the raid ends\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eI’m still losing my items in laboratory, is there a way to change this?\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003eSimulateItemsBeingTaken\u003c/code\u003e is overridden if insurance is disabled on the map. You can use \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/236/server-value-modifier-svm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eSVM\u003c/a\u003e by \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/3972/ghostfenixx\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eGhostFenixx\u003c/a\u003e to enable insurance inside laboratory, \u003ccode\u003eRaid Settings -\u0026gt; Misc -\u0026gt; Working insurance inside Laboratory\u003c/code\u003e is checked\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tab-title\"\u003eSupport\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab-content\"\u003e\u003ch4\u003eSupport\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you find bugs, or have feature suggestions, feel free to post them on the comment section, or open an issue on GitHub, or most preferably through the \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1374428464999829555\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eSPT Discord, \u003ccode\u003eozen\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eChanges from Insurance Plus\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA huge thank you to \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/41131/mattdokn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMattdokn\u003c/a\u003e for allowing me to continue his work on \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1545/insurance-plus\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInsurance Plus\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSimulate items being taken. Some items might still get sent by mail when the container that holds the item is taken, but not the item itself\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUses SPT methods to simulate items being taken, thank you SPT team!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePorted to the new SPT C# Server\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you enjoy my work, you can \u003ca target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/ozenm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ebuy me a coffee\u003c/a\u003e ☕\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePolicy Notice:\u003c/strong\u003e Insurance scamming is not tolerated. Those items dropped in-raid will be processed through the regular insurance system.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n",
